{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "title": "Durable Agent Runner \u2014 edited-paced replay of actual outputs", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDurable Agent Runner\r\nWhat this project demonstrates\r\n\r\nA job advances one durable step per transaction. The demonstrated business effect is stored in the same database transaction as its checkpoint, so a restart cannot duplicate that local effect.\r\n"]
[10, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDurable Agent Runner\r\nActual fixture demo output\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n  \"python\": \"3.12.13\",\r\n  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-10-31T13:52:14.524491+00:00\",\r\n  \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.0149,\r\n  \"result\": {\r\n    \"checkpoint\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"6eabbe3e-c6fb-4bc7-a91e-165ae96a2788\",\r\n      \"state\": \"running\",\r\n      \"step\": 1,\r\n      \"result\": {\r\n        \"sum\": 6\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    \"completed\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"6eabbe3e-c6fb-4bc7-a91e-165ae96a2788\",\r\n      \"state\": \"done\",\r\n      \"step\": 3,\r\n      \"result\": {\r\n        \"sum\": 6\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    \"effects\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"job_id\": \"6eabbe3e-c6fb-4bc7-a91e-165ae96a2788\",\r\n        \"body\": {\r\n          \"sum\": 6\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]
[20, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDurable Agent Runner\r\nBehavior under test\r\n\r\n..                                                                       [100%]\r\n2 passed in 0.26s"]
[30, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDurable Agent Runner\r\nMeasured evaluation / fixture mode\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"passed\": true,\r\n  \"scenario\": {\r\n    \"checkpoint\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"20f9d21c-22bc-4c6e-bb88-4b27d29d9b4d\",\r\n      \"state\": \"running\",\r\n      \"step\": 1,\r\n      \"result\": {\r\n        \"sum\": 6\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    \"completed\": {\r\n      \"id\": \"20f9d21c-22bc-4c6e-bb88-4b27d29d9b4d\",\r\n      \"state\": \"done\",\r\n      \"step\": 3,\r\n      \"result\": {\r\n        \"sum\": 6\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    \"effects\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"job_id\": \"20f9d21c-22bc-4c6e-bb88-4b27d29d9b4d\",\r\n        \"body\": {\r\n          \"sum\": 6\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}"]
[40, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDurable Agent Runner\r\nTradeoffs to explain at interview\r\n\r\nExactly-once behavior is limited to the demonstrated local database transaction. Remote tools require idempotency keys or an outbox. There is no distributed scheduler or worker lease in this small runner.\r\n"]
[50, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HDurable Agent Runner\r\nRun it yourself\r\n\r\ngit clone https://github.com/danielpdev/durable-agent-runner.git\r\ncd durable-agent-runner\r\nmake setup\r\nmake demo\r\nmake test\r\nmake eval\r\n\r\nSee README.md and docs/INTERVIEW_RO.md.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted portfolio project. Synthetic data.\r\nNo production customer claims."]
